+// waitForVDiff waits for a vdiff to complete. It displays its progress every
+// updateInterval, and the final summary when it completes. It checks the state
+// more often than that, starting at initialWaitCheckInterval and backing off up
+// to maxWaitCheckInterval, so that it returns soon after the vdiff completes rather
+// than on the next update interval: waiting for a vdiff that takes a few seconds
